{#
    FR-049. The single response for a code that is unknown, deactivated or fully used.

    It names no trainer and no reason, and the controller returns it with 404, because telling
    the three apart would let a visitor learn which codes exist. Do not add detail here.
#}
{% extends 'join/_layout.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}This link is not available{% endblock %}
{% block heading %}This link is not available{% endblock %}

{% block join_content %}
    <p>
        The link you followed does not work. It may have been withdrawn, already used, or typed
        incorrectly.
    </p>

    <p>Ask whoever sent it to you for a new one.</p>
{% endblock %}
